        "start_line": 17,
        "text": "  rule xOrYBody\n    => If(Compare(Name(\"n\"), CmpOp(\"<\", Int(2))),\n          Return(Name(\"y\")),\n          .Stmts)\n       For(Name(\"divisor\"), Call(Name(\"range\"), (Int(2), Name(\"n\"))),\n           xOrYLoopBody)\n       Return(Name(\"x\"))"
      },
